WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.405
Communicate clearly and recover from an error Trust should make

00:00:04.405 --> 00:00:09.275
a useful question easier to ask Agree a communication rhythm

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:16.135
approved channels and a fallback Distinguish receipt decision and completion

00:00:16.135 --> 00:00:18.825
When you make an error correct the message and the

00:00:18.825 --> 00:00:22.125
controlled record and confirm that the affected people can act

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:26.215
on the correction A concern involving the executive needs an

00:00:26.215 --> 00:00:32.365
appropriate alternative reporting route Choose a helpful clarification then draft

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:37.335
a concise correction to an appointment time Identify an alternative

00:00:37.335 --> 00:00:39.990
concern route if the executive is the subject of the

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.465
concern
